<DownloadLayout platform="windows" title="Windows" description="Download the x64 EXE installer from the latest official Refract release.">
  <h2>Install on Windows</h2><ol><li>Download the EXE installer that matches your processor.</li><li>Run the installer and follow its prompts.</li><li>Open Refract and add your Microsoft account to play Minecraft: Java Edition.</li></ol><p>If Refract cannot open, check that Microsoft's WebView2 runtime is installed. See the <a href="/wiki/getting-started/installing/">installation guide</a> for more help.</p>
</DownloadLayout>
